sequenceDiagram
  participant Q as Request Queue
  participant S as Rack Shuttle
  participant R as Rack
  participant B as Input Buffer
  participant L as Reader-side Loader
  participant D as Reader
  participant O as Output Staging
  Q->>S: Dispatch merged platter work
  S->>R: Fetch platter
  S->>B: Deliver to rack-facing port
  alt Buffer slot available
    B->>L: Stage platter
  else Buffer full
    S-->>S: Wait outside buffer
    B-->>S: Retry when a slot opens
    S->>B: Stage platter
  end
  L->>D: Load platter
  D-->>Q: Complete logical requests after read
  D->>O: Unload completed platter
  O->>S: Release return task
  S->>R: Return platter to home slot
